{{- /*
Values table for the documentation site.

helm-docs' built-in table renders the Key column as bare text while every other
identifier on the page is monospaced, which makes a long table harder to scan
than it needs to be. This is the built-in table with the key wrapped in a code
span; nothing else differs.

It is passed explicitly with `-t` by hack/gen-helm-docs.py. The chart's own
README.md is hand written and is not produced from any template.
*/ -}}
| Key | Type | Default | Description |
|-----|------|---------|-------------|
{{- range .Values }}
| `{{ .Key }}` | {{ .Type }} | {{ if .Default }}{{ .Default }}{{ else }}{{ .AutoDefault }}{{ end }} | {{ if .Description }}{{ .Description }}{{ else }}{{ .AutoDescription }}{{ end }} |
{{- end }}
